-- powergrid-trainee-engineer-electronics-33-posts-20261119 (asia; English 583 words; Nepali 455 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'powergrid-trainee-engineer-electronics-33-posts-20261119', 'asia', 'India',
'POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics Recruitment 2026: 33 Posts Through GATE 2026',
'पावरग्रिड ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स भर्ती 2026: GATE 2026 बाट 33 पद',
'POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics recruitment 2026 opens 33 posts in PowerTel for electronics graduates with a GATE 2026 EC score. Apply at powergrid.in by 27 November 2026.',
'पावरग्रिड ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स भर्ती 2026 मा GATE 2026 EC स्कोर भएका इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स स्नातकका लागि PowerTel मा 33 पद खुलेका छन्। powergrid.in मा 27 नोभेम्बर 2026 सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>Power Grid Corporation of India Limited (POWERGRID) has opened POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics recruitment 2026 for 33 Trainee Engineer (Electronics) posts in its wholly owned subsidiary POWERGRID Teleservice Limited (PowerTel), under Advertisement No. CC/04/2026 dated 13 November 2026. Only candidates who qualified the GATE 2026 Electronics and Communication paper can apply, and online applications run at powergrid.in from 13 November to 27 November 2026.</p><h2>POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics recruitment 2026 at a glance</h2><table><tbody><tr><td>Advertisement</td><td>CC/04/2026, dated 13 November 2026, Post ID 569</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Trainee Engineer (Electronics), PowerTel</td></tr><tr><td>Total posts</td><td>33 (UR 14, OBC 7, SC 6, ST 3, EWS 3)</td></tr><tr><td>Apply online</td><td>13 November (5 PM) to 27 November 2026 (11:59 PM)</td></tr><tr><td>Application fee</td><td>Rs 500 (General/OBC-NCL/EWS)</td></tr><tr><td>Age limit</td><td>18 to 28 years as on 27 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>Rs 30,000 to Rs 1,20,000 during one-year training, plus IDA, HRA and perks; about Rs 14.33 lakh CTC a year</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>GATE 2026 marks, Behavioural Assessment, Group Discussion, Interview, medical</td></tr><tr><td>Apply at</td><td>powergrid.in</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics recruitment offers</h2><p>All 33 posts are for Trainee Engineer (Electronics) in PowerTel, the telecom arm of POWERGRID, and the recruitment is run by POWERGRID on behalf of its subsidiary. Training lasts one year in the pay scale of Rs 30,000 to Rs 1,20,000, with IDA, HRA and perks at 12 percent of basic pay a month, and an approximate CTC of Rs 14.33 lakh a year. Selection starts from normalised GATE 2026 marks out of 100, carrying 85 percent weightage, followed by a Behavioural Assessment, a Group Discussion, a Personal Interview and a pre-employment medical examination. Readers tracking other GATE-based PSU openings can also see our reports on the <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bel-probationary-engineer-350-posts-20261028'>BEL Probationary Engineer recruitment for 350 posts</a> and the <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/nlc-india-graduate-executive-trainee-143-posts-20261115'>NLC India Graduate Executive Trainee recruitment for 143 posts</a>.</p><h2>Who can apply for POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics</h2><p>Applicants need a full-time B.E., B.Tech or B.Sc (Engineering) degree in Electronics or an equivalent discipline, with a minimum of 60 percent marks or an equivalent CGPA, and must have appeared in and qualified the GATE 2026 Electronics and Communication (EC) paper. Only the valid GATE 2026 score is considered, and scores from earlier GATE examinations are not accepted. The age limit is 18 to 28 years as on 27 November 2026, with relaxations as per the rules.</p><h2>How to apply for POWERGRID Trainee Engineer Electronics</h2><p>Register online at powergrid.in using your GATE 2026 application number and GATE 2026 registration number, find Advertisement No. CC/04/2026 for Trainee Engineer (Electronics) in PowerTel, and complete the application and fee payment by 27 November 2026 at 11:59 PM. Read the full advertisement before applying, because the eligibility conditions, including the accepted Electronics disciplines and the GATE qualifying marks, are set out in the notification itself.</p><h2>What the notification does not say</h2><p>This is a different drive from the unverified POWERGRID ET 435 claim that circulated on some job sites: that figure was contradicted by independent sources and is not this recruitment, which is Advt CC/04/2026 for 33 posts in PowerTel through GATE 2026. The fee exemption for SC, ST and PwD candidates was not confirmed in the sources checked, so candidates in those categories should check the advertisement for the exact fee position. This is the smallest drive in this batch of jobs at 33 posts, and all 33 seats are in the single Electronics discipline.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Applications and fees go only through the official POWERGRID website. Anyone asking for money outside that channel, or promising selection in exchange for payment, is running a scam.</p><p>Sources: Power Grid Corporation of India Limited, Advertisement No. CC/04/2026, powergrid.in; <a href='https://www.freejobalert.com/articles/powergrid-trainee-engineer-electronics-recruitment-2026-3080902'>FreeJobAlert</a>; <a href='https://jobsplane.in/2026/powergrid-trainee-engineer-nov26/'>JobsPlane</a>; <a href='https://quicksarkari.com/pgcil-powertel-trainee-engineer-recruitment-2026-27/'>Quick Sarkari</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>पावर ग्रिड कर्पोरेसन अफ इन्डिया लिमिटेड (POWERGRID) ले विज्ञापन नं. CC/04/2026 (13 नोभेम्बर 2026) अन्तर्गत आफ्नो पूर्ण स्वामित्वको सहायक कम्पनी पावरग्रिड टेलिसर्भिस लिमिटेड (PowerTel) मा ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर (इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स) का 33 पदका लागि पावरग्रिड ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स भर्ती 2026 खुलाएको छ। GATE 2026 इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स तथा सञ्चार पेपरमा योग्य भएका उम्मेदवारले मात्र आवेदन दिन सक्छन्, र powergrid.in मा 13 नोभेम्बरदेखि 27 नोभेम्बर 2026 सम्म अनलाइन आवेदन दिन सकिन्छ।</p><h2>एक नजरमा</h2><table><tbody><tr><td>विज्ञापन</td><td>CC/04/2026, 13 नोभेम्बर 2026, पद ID 569</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर (इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स), PowerTel</td></tr><tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>33 (सामान्य 14, OBC 7, SC 6, ST 3, EWS 3)</td></tr><tr><td>अनलाइन आवेदन</td><td>13 नोभेम्बर (साँझ 5) देखि 27 नोभेम्बर 2026 (राति 11:59) सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन शुल्क</td><td>500 रुपैयाँ (सामान्य/OBC-NCL/EWS)</td></tr><tr><td>उमेर सीमा</td><td>27 नोभेम्बर 2026 का आधारमा 18 देखि 28 वर्ष</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>एक वर्षको तालिममा 30,000 देखि 1,20,000 रुपैयाँ, IDA, HRA र सुविधासहित; करिब 14.33 लाख वार्षिक CTC</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>GATE 2026 अंक, व्यवहार मूल्याङ्कन, समूह छलफल, अन्तर्वार्ता, स्वास्थ्य परीक्षण</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन गर्ने ठाउँ</td><td>powergrid.in</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पदबारे</h2><p>सबै 33 पद PowerTel मा ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर (इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स) का हुन्, जुन POWERGRID को दूरसञ्चार शाखा हो, र भर्ती POWERGRID ले आफ्नो सहायक कम्पनीका तर्फबाट चलाएको हो। तालिम एक वर्षको हुन्छ, 30,000 देखि 1,20,000 रुपैयाँको तलबमानमा, IDA, HRA र आधारभूत तलबको 12 प्रतिशत सुविधासहित, र करिब 14.33 लाख रुपैयाँ वार्षिक CTC सहित। छनोट 100 मध्ये सामान्यीकृत GATE 2026 अंकबाट सुरु हुन्छ, जसको 85 प्रतिशत भार हुन्छ, त्यसपछि व्यवहार मूल्याङ्कन, समूह छलफल, व्यक्तिगत अन्तर्वार्ता र रोजगारीपूर्व स्वास्थ्य परीक्षण हुन्छ।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकसँग इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स वा सोसरहको विधामा पूर्णकालीन B.E., B.Tech वा B.Sc (इन्जिनियरिङ) डिग्री हुनुपर्छ, न्यूनतम 60 प्रतिशत अंक वा सोसरहको CGPA सहित, र GATE 2026 इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स तथा सञ्चार (EC) पेपरमा बसेर योग्य भएको हुनुपर्छ। मान्य GATE 2026 स्कोर मात्र मानिन्छ, र अघिल्ला GATE परीक्षाका स्कोर मानिँदैनन्। उमेर सीमा 27 नोभेम्बर 2026 का आधारमा 18 देखि 28 वर्ष छ, नियमअनुसार छुट छ।</p><h2>आवेदन कसरी दिने</h2><p>आफ्नो GATE 2026 आवेदन नम्बर र GATE 2026 दर्ता नम्बर प्रयोग गरी powergrid.in मा अनलाइन दर्ता गर्नुहोस्, PowerTel मा ट्रेनी इन्जिनियर (इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स) का लागि विज्ञापन नं. CC/04/2026 खोज्नुहोस्, र 27 नोभेम्बर 2026 राति 11:59 सम्म आवेदन र शुल्क भुक्तानी पूरा गर्नुहोस्। आवेदन दिनुअघि पूरा विज्ञापन पढ्नुहोस्, किनभने स्वीकार्य इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स विधा र GATE योग्यता अंकसहितका योग्यता सर्त सूचनामै दिइएको छ।</p><h2>सूचनामा के छैन</h2><p>यो केही जागिर साइटमा फैलिएको अपुष्ट POWERGRID ET 435 दाबीभन्दा फरक अभियान हो: त्यो संख्या स्वतन्त्र स्रोतहरूले खण्डन गरेका थिए र यो भर्ती होइन, जुन GATE 2026 बाट PowerTel मा 33 पदका लागि विज्ञापन CC/04/2026 हो। SC, ST र PwD उम्मेदवारका लागि शुल्क छुट जाँच गरिएका स्रोतहरूमा पुष्टि भएको छैन, त्यसैले ती श्रेणीका उम्मेदवारले सही शुल्क स्थितिका लागि विज्ञापन हेर्नुपर्छ। यो यस ब्याचका जागिरहरूमा सबैभन्दा सानो अभियान हो — 33 पद — र सबै 33 सिट एउटै इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स विधामा छन्।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> आवेदन र शुल्क आधिकारिक POWERGRID वेबसाइटबाट मात्र जान्छ। त्यो माध्यमबाहिर पैसा माग्ने वा पैसामा छनोट गराइदिने भन्ने जो कोही ठग हो।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: पावर ग्रिड कर्पोरेसन अफ इन्डिया लिमिटेड, विज्ञापन नं. CC/04/2026, powergrid.in; FreeJobAlert; JobsPlane; Quick Sarkari।</p>$$,
